{"id":"d094a29c337769c3","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-full-support.md","title":"Full Support","display":"df-full-support — Full Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-full-support","aliases":["58-df-full-support"],"display":"df-full-support — Full Support","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-full-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-full-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-full-support — Full Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\)</span> (iteration length, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma\\)</span> (iterand carriers), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathbf1\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\)</span> (coordinatewise top elements), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\">\\(p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullSupport}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{FullSupport}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (full-support predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\)</span> 的域上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)\\)</span> 是下式定义的函数值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma=\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf1)\">\\(\\gamma=\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf1)\\)</span>，故不隐含另一个长度参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FullSupport}_S(p,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbf1,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma\\land\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\gamma\\land\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)=\\{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FullSupport}_S(p,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbf1,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma\\land\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\gamma\\land\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)=\\{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\to\n\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\ne\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha&lt;\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\to\n\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\ne\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In a full-support product or iteration, every condition has full domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>; coordinates may still carry the supplied top element <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\)</span>, so its nontrivial support need not equal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>They can add new branches to trees.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)$ (iteration length, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1\\in\\prod_{\\alpha<\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha<\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullSupport}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha<\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma=\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbf1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}full\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{FullSupport}_S(p,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbf1,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathbb Q\\in V^\\gamma\\land\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha<\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=\\gamma\\land\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)=\\{\\alpha<\\gamma:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf1,p\\in\\prod_{\\alpha<\\gamma}\\mathbb Q(\\alpha)\\to\n\\operatorname{support}_{\\mathbf1}(p)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\ne\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1680,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-559","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-full-support.md|58-df-full-support]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","c5203cd487b6ba6d"]}